### [CXC-PC-HEARTBEAT-DEFERRED] The heartbeat plug-in and pluggable time tick are a later item, not scheduled and not in v0.1

- shape: the heartbeat is a plug-in under THIS contract declaring both hosts; the time tick is one configured pulse; agents receive pulse messages only through the mailbox or by reading the topic (the mailbox-only inbound rule).
- rule: v0.1 MUST NOT include any heartbeat or scheduler field; hello-world does not exercise one ([CXC-PC-RULE-SIZE]).
- verify-machine: none — a recorded non-goal; the schema carries no scheduler or pulse field.
- verify-human: none required.
- status: deferred
- provenance: david-ruling for the intent and "Not critical for now" (HoP); architect-synthesis for the shape (the shape is gnomon-architect's summary, marked as its proposal in GM-0216).
