### `record_decline` writes one consent line and nothing else: it never installs, upgrades, uninstalls, enables, disables or configures, never calls the gate or a host callback, and never contacts the plug-in [CXC-PC-V02-RECORD-DECLINE-SIDE-EFFECTS]

- never-does: (1) call `install`, `upgrade`, `uninstall`, `enable`, `disable` or `configure`, or any internal that they use (`_gate`, `_fresh`, `_place_code`); (2) write `installs.json`, `installs.jsonl`, any config file or anything under the install root; (3) change the installed record, installed files, grants, the bus or the stored config; (4) call the gate or ANY method of the `Host` (`consent_gate`, `publish_status`, `bus`, `validate_section`, `render_section`, `extra_panels`, and any other); reading the attributes `host.name` and `host.state_root` is allowed; (5) start, stop, import, spawn or contact the plug-in or its process; (6) read the package at `prompt.source`.
- reads: `installs.json`, read-only, for the staleness check, and nothing else.
- needs-nothing-installed: an install decline needs no install record and creates none; an upgrade decline on an installed domain leaves that installation exactly as it was.
- observable-form: for the whole state root, every file other than `consent.jsonl` is identical before and after in path set, size, sha256 and modification time; `consent.jsonl` after equals `consent.jsonl` before plus exactly one line, and its earlier bytes are unchanged.
- verify-machine: CXC-PC-V02-T-RD-ONE-RECORD-NOTHING-ELSE-CHANGES (the observable form), CXC-PC-V02-T-RD-INSTALLED-DOMAIN-UNCHANGED (the installed record and running plug-in), CXC-PC-V02-T-RD-ZERO-GATE-AND-HOST-CALLBACKS (a spy on the Host and on every internal named in item 1, plus process-spawn and import spies).
- verify-human: none required — fully machine-observable.
- tested-by: [CXC-PC-V02-T-RD-ONE-RECORD-NOTHING-ELSE-CHANGES], [CXC-PC-V02-T-RD-INSTALLED-DOMAIN-UNCHANGED], [CXC-PC-V02-T-RD-ZERO-GATE-AND-HOST-CALLBACKS]
- evidence: PASS at composeio main e5c82fb000b8be82e0f14e4f4820da40736ea954 (PR #17, tag plugin-contract-v0.2, compose-plugins 0.2.0): python/compose_plugins/tests/test_v02_record_decline.py: test_CXC_PC_V02_T_RD_ONE_RECORD_NOTHING_ELSE_CHANGES, test_CXC_PC_V02_T_RD_ONE_RECORD_NOTHING_ELSE_CHANGES_decided_by_refused, test_CXC_PC_V02_T_RD_INSTALLED_DOMAIN_UNCHANGED, test_CXC_PC_V02_T_RD_ZERO_GATE_AND_HOST_CALLBACKS; the compose_plugins full suite at that commit: 1359 passed, 0 skipped, rc 0 (raw output sha256 d1fc46f1ce473da0f30ddab1894dd8a39ce5e3f32fd5a68025beec1eaaf52996; it counts these tests and does not list them by name); independent candidate review at that commit, round 2: PASS_WITH_NOTES. Filled 2026-11-27 from the build, review and push reports.
