### Test 5: an unprepared prompt is refused, writing nothing [CXC-PC-V02-T-RD-UNPREPARED-REFUSED]

- procedure: against a manager with a real prompt Q available, call `record_decline` with: (a) a `ConsentPrompt` built by hand with every field copied from Q but no issue token; (b) a prompt prepared by a second manager instance on the same state root; (c) `dataclasses.replace(Q, manifest_sha256="0"*64)`; (d) None, a dict and a string. Snapshot the state root as in test 1 before each call.
