### Test 6: a stale prompt is refused, writing nothing [CXC-PC-V02-T-RD-STALE-REFUSED]

- procedure: (a) prepare an install prompt, install the plug-in by another call, then decline the prompt; (b) prepare an upgrade prompt, disable the plug-in, then decline; (c) prepare an upgrade prompt, uninstall, then decline; (d) decline a fresh prompt successfully, then decline the same prompt again; (e) prepare 1025 prompts and decline the first. Snapshot the state root before each refused call.
- asserts: (a) to (d) raise `PromptStale` with the reasons stated in CXC-PC-V02-RECORD-DECLINE-PROMPT-VALIDITY; (e) raises `PromptNotPrepared`; for every refused call the state root is identical, including consent.jsonl.
