- evidence-fills-with: the installs.jsonl and consent.jsonl of a real conformance run with the library commit and the sha256 of each file
- decision-source: the request recorded in Gnomon spec 50, key owner-rulings-slice-1-2026-11-26; each transition carries its manifest_sha256 and its consent record
