- procedure: with a stub host whose `policy` returns one host warning for `agent-messaging` and, in a second run, `refuse="no agents here"`; install a 0.3 manifest declaring `agent-messaging` and one warning, first with a full mapping, then with a missing key, an extra key and a wrong digest; repeat through the web manager with every box set and with one clear; run an upgrade that widens and carries the same warnings; run a `policy` that raises.
